# Build context for the OGN relay image — PLAN §5.3.
#
# ⚠️ Everything here is excluded because `az acr build` TARS AND UPLOADS the context before it reads
# the Dockerfile. Without this file that means shipping `data/` to the cloud on every build, and
# `data/` holds the source tiles — including a 568 MB canopy geopackage and gigabytes of DGM1 and
# LoD2 tiles. The image itself needs `server/` and `config/` and nothing else, so the exclusions
# are broad on purpose: this is about what crosses the wire, not only what lands in the layer.
*

# ...and then only what the relay actually reads.
!server/
!config/

# Belt and braces: nothing generated or downloaded, even under the two folders above.
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/*.log
